  - The project was renamed throughout: identifiers, crate, package, module and
    binary names, environment variables, on-disk paths, wire formats, file and
    folder names, documentation, examples and CI configuration.
  - The README was rewritten.
  - The hosted platform components that were licensed under AGPL-3.0 (apps/api,
    apps/dashboard, apps/image-service, apps/infra, apps/otel-collector,
